t a defined axis.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-CentiM2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-M2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-MilliM2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/LB-FT2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/LB-IN2"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M1H0T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The rotational inertia or resistance to change in direction or speed of rotation about a defined\n    axis.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentOfInertia"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/RotationalMass"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"I_{y}","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MomentOfInertia","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"},{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:RotationalMass","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Moment of Inertia in the Y Axis","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":[{"@value":"MOI","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentOfInertia"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/RotationalMass"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentOfInertia_Z","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The rotational inertia or resistance to change in direction or speed of rotation about a defined axis.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-CentiM2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-M2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-MilliM2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/LB-FT2"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/LB-IN2"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M1H0T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The rotational inertia or resistance to change in direction or speed of rotation about a defined\n    axis.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentOfInertia"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/RotationalMass"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"I_{z}","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MomentOfInertia","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"},{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:RotationalMass","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Moment of Inertia in the Z Axis","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":[{"@value":"MOI","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentOfInertia"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/RotationalMass"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Momentum","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The momentum of a system of particles is given by the sum of the momentums of the individual particles\n    which make up the system or by the product of the total mass of the system and the velocity of the center of gravity of the\n    system. The momentum of a continuous medium is given by the integral of the velocity over the mass of the medium or by the\n    product of the total mass of the medium and the velocity of the center of gravity of the medium.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloGM-M-PER-SEC"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaEV-PER-SpeedOfLight"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/N-M-SEC-PER-M"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/N-SEC"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PlanckMomentum"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/dbpediaMatch":[{"@value":"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Momentum","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exactMatch":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/LinearMomentum"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M1H0T-1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Momentum","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The momentum of a system of particles is given by the sum of the momentums of the individual\n    particles which make up the system or by the product of the total mass of the system and the velocity of the center of gravity\n    of the system. The momentum of a continuous medium is given by the integral of the velocity over the mass of the medium or by\n    the product of the total mass of the medium and the velocity of the center of gravity of the medium.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"p","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q41273"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Momentum","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Impuls","@language":"de"},{"@value":"Momentum","@language":"en"},{"@value":"Momentum","@language":"ms"},{"@value":"Momentum","@language":"tr"},{"@value":"cantidad de movimiento","@language":"es"},{"@value":"gibalna količina","@language":"sl"},{"@value":"hybnost","@language":"cs"},{"@value":"impuls","@language":"ro"},{"@value":"momento linear","@language":"pt"},{"@value":"pęd","@language":"pl"},{"@value":"quantità di moto","@language":"it"},{"@value":"quantité de mouvement","@language":"fr"},{"@value":"импульс","@language":"ru"},{"@value":"تکانه","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"زخم الحركة","@language":"ar"},{"@value":"动量","@language":"zh"},{"@value":"運動量","@language":"ja"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MomentumPerAngle","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/N-SEC-PER-RAD"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M1H0T-1D0"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MomentumPerAngle","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Momentum per Angle","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MorbidityRate","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"Morbidity rate is a measure of the incidence of a disease in a particular population, scaled to the size\n    of that population, per unit of time.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CASES-PER-HUNDRED-THOUSAND-INDIV-YR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CASES-PER-KiloINDIV-YR"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T-1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/organizedUnder":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Morbidity rate is a measure of the incidence of a disease in a particular population, scaled to the\n    size of that population, per unit of time.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvDenominator":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvNumerator":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MorbidityRate","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Morbidity Rate","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MortalityRate","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"Mortality rate, or death rate, is a measure of the number of deaths (in general, or due to a specific\n    cause) in a particular population, scaled to the size of that population, per unit of time.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEATHS-PER-HUNDRED-THOUSAND-INDIV-YR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEATHS-PER-KiloINDIV-YR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEATHS-PER-MegaINDIV-YR"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T-1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mortality_rate","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/organizedUnder":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Mortality rate, or death rate, is a measure of the number of deaths (in general, or due to a\n    specific cause) in a particular population, scaled to the size of that population, per unit of time.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvDenominator":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvNumerator":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MortalityRate","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Mortality Rate","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CountRate"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MotorConstant","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The motor constant, or motor size constant, $K_m = \\tau / \\sqrt{P}$, is the torque of a motor divided\n    by the square root of the power dissipated in its windings. It measures how effectively a motor produces torque per unit of\n    resistive loss, independently of how the windings are wound, and is expressed in newton metres per square root watt\n    ($N \\cdot m / \\sqrt{W}$). Because it involves the square root of a power, its dimension carries the fractional exponents\n    $L^{1} M^{1/2} T^{-1/2}$. The term \"motor constant\" is also used in the literature for two distinct quantities: the torque\n    constant $K_t = \\tau / I$ (see quantitykind:TorqueConstant) and the back-EMF constant $K_e = V / \\omega$, both of which have\n    the dimension of magnetic flux and are numerically equal to one another in coherent SI units.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/N-M-PER-W0dot5"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/eclassCode":[{"@value":"0173-1#Z4-BAJ358#005","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M0dot5H0T-0dot5D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/iec61360Code":[{"@value":"0112/2///62720#UAD129","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://cdd.iec.ch/cdd/iec62720/iec62720.nsf/ListsOfUnitsAllVersions/0112-2---62720%23UAD129","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition":[{"@value":"$K_m = \\frac{\\tau}{\\sqrt{P}}$, where $\\tau$ is the motor torque and $P$ is the power dissipated in the windings.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Größe, die eine Eigenschaft eines Motors kennzeichnet","@language":"de"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MotorConstant","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Motor Constant","@language":"en-us"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/TorqueConstant"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MultiplicationFactor","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The \"Multiplication Factor\" is the ratio of the total number of fission or fission-dependent neutrons\n    produced in a time interval to the total number of neutrons lost by absorption and leakage during the same interval.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_multiplication_factor","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The \"Multiplication Factor\" is the ratio of the total number of fission or fission-dependent\n    neutrons produced in a time interval to the total number of neutrons lost by absorption and leakage during the same interval.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"k","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q99440471"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MultiplicationFactor","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Multiplication Factor","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MutualInductance","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"$\\textit{Mutual Inductance}$ is the non-diagonal term of the inductance matrix. For two loops, the\n    symbol $M$ is used for $L_{12}$.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/H"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/H_Ab"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/H_Stat"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloH"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MicroH"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliH"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoH"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PicoH"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E-2L2I0M1H0T-2D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.electropedia.org/iev/iev.nsf/display?openform&ievref=131-12-36","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"},{"@value":"https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/60010","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition":[{"@value":"$L_{mn} = \\frac{\\Psi_m}{I_n}$, where $I_n$ is an electric current in a thin conducting loop $n$ and $\\Psi_m$ is the linked flux caused by that electric current in another loop $m$.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Inductance"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"L_{mn}","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q78101401"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Inductance","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Mutual Inductance","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Inductance"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Inductance"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NOMINAL-ASCENT-PROPELLANT-MASS","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The amount of propellant mass within a stage that is available for impulse for use in nominal payload\n    performance prediction. This mass excludes loaded propellant that has been set aside for off- nominal performance behavior\n    (FPR and fuel bias).\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecated":[{"@value":"true","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecatedInVersion":[{"@value":"3.2.0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M1H0T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://elib.dlr.de/68314/1/IAF10-D2.3.1.pdf","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The amount of propellant mass within a stage that is available for impulse for use in nominal\n    payload performance prediction. This mass excludes loaded propellant that has been set aside for off- nominal performance\n    behavior (FPR and fuel bias).\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Nominal Ascent Propellant Mass","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Mass"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NapierianAbsorbance","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"Napierian Absorbance is the natural (Napierian) logarithm of the reciprocal of the spectral internal\n    transmittance.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Absorbance#Beer-Lambert_law","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"},{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beer%E2%80%93Lambert_law#Formulation","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition":[{"@value":"$A_e(\\lambda) = -ln(\\tau(\\lambda))$, where $\\tau$ is the transmittance at a given wavelength $\\lambda$.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Napierian Absorbance is the natural (Napierian) logarithm of the reciprocal of the spectral\n    internal transmittance.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"A_e, B","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q85664557"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NapierianAbsorbance","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Napierian Absorbance","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NaturalLogarithmicMedianInformationFlow","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"ratio of the median information content divided by the expected value for the duration of a character,\n    expressed as a logarithm to base e\n  ","@language":"en"}],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/InformationFlowRate"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecated":[{"@value":"true","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecatedInVersion":[{"@value":"3.5.0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/eclassCode":[{"@value":"0173-1#Z4-BAJ471#001","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T-1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Quotient mittlerer Informationsgehalt durch den Erwartungswert für die Dauer eines Zeichens,\n    ausgedrückt als Logarithmus zur Basis e\n  ","@language":"de"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Median Information Flow (from a Source of Information), Expressed as a Natural Logarithm ","@language":"en-us"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeelTemperature","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"\"Neel Temperature\" is the critical thermodynamic temperature of an antiferromagnet.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/K"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H1T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Néel_temperature","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31897","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"\"Neel Temperature\" is the critical thermodynamic temperature of an antiferromagnet.","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Temperature"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"T_C","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeelTemperature","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neel Temperature","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Temperature"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/CurieTemperature"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/SuperconductionTransitionTemperature"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NetTonnage","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/TON_Register"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L3I0M0H0T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Net_tonnage","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Net tonnage is used in the United States to determine eligibility for registering boats with\n the federal government. It is a nonlinear unit derived from the total volume of a ship's cargo space as well as some\n dimensionless factors. Net tonnage is not a measure of the weight of the ship or its cargo, and should not be confused\n with terms such as deadweight tonnage or displacement. Net tonnage is also used to determine the amount of money that\n can be charged to a ship for using a port's facilities.","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Volume"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"NT","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NetTonnage","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Net Tonnage","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Volume"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutralRatio","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"ratio between two physical variables of the same type, expressed as a number which describes the\n    relationship between these variables where the units are cancelled against each other\n  ","@language":"en"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/eclassCode":[{"@value":"0173-1#Z4-BAJ359#005","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/organizedUnder":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/DimensionlessRatio"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"Quotient aus zwei physikalischen Größen gleicher Art als Zahl, welche das Verhältnis dieser Größen\n    zueinander ausdrückt, wobei die einheiten gegeneinander gekürzt sind\n  ","@language":"de"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeutralRatio","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neutral Ratio","@language":"en-us"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/DimensionlessRatio"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutronDiffusionCoefficient","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M2-PER-SEC"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M0H0T-1D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://encyclopedia2.thefreedictionary.com/Diffusion+of+Neutrons","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition":[{"@value":"$D_n = -\\frac{J_x}{\\frac{\\partial dn}{\\partial dx}}$, where $J_x$ is the $x-component$ of the particle current and $n$ is the particle number density.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"D","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q105623303"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeutronDiffusionCoefficient","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Diffusion Coefficient","@language":"en"},{"@value":"Diffusionskoeffizient","@language":"de"},{"@value":"coefficient de diffusion","@language":"fr"},{"@value":"coefficiente di diffusione","@language":"it"},{"@value":"coeficiente de difusión","@language":"es"},{"@value":"coeficiente de difusão","@language":"pt"},{"@value":"difuzijski koeficient","@language":"sl"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutronDiffusionLength","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The neutron diffusion length is equivalent to the relaxation length, that is, to the distance, in which\n    the neutron flux decreases by a factor e\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/ANGSTROM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/AU"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/BTU_IT-PER-LB_F"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CHAIN"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CHAIN_US"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CentiM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DecaM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DeciM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FATH"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FT"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FT_US"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FUR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/FemtoM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/GAUGE_FR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/GA_Charriere"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/HectoM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/IN"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/LY"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MI"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MI_N"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MI_UK"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MI_US"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MicroIN"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MicroM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilLength"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliIN"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PARSEC"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PCA"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PT"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PicoM"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PlanckLength"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/ROD"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/YD"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/ZOLL"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M0H0T0D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The neutron diffusion length is equivalent to the relaxation length, that is, to the distance, in\n    which the neutron flux decreases by a factor e\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/specializationOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Length"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"L_{r}","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Length","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neutron Diffusion Length","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Length"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutronNumber","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"\"Neutron Number\", symbol $N$, is the number of neutrons in a nuclide. Nuclides with the same value of $N$\n    but different values of $Z$ are called isotones. $N - Z$ is called the neutron excess number.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/COUNT"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NUM"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/home/store/catalogue_tc/catalogue_detail.htm?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"},{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neutron_number","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/organizedUnder":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Count"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"N","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q970319"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeutronNumber","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neutron Number","@language":"en"},{"@value":"Neutronenzahl","@language":"de"},{"@value":"Neutronové číslo","@language":"cs"},{"@value":"Nombor neutron","@language":"ms"},{"@value":"Nombre de neutrons","@language":"fr"},{"@value":"liczba neutronowa","@language":"pl"},{"@value":"numero neutronico","@language":"it"},{"@value":"nötron snumarası","@language":"tr"},{"@value":"número de neutrons","@language":"pt"},{"@value":"número neutrónico","@language":"es"},{"@value":"число нейтронов","@language":"ru"},{"@value":"عدد النيوترونات","@language":"ar"},{"@value":"عدد نوترون","@language":"fa"},{"@value":"中子數","@language":"zh"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Count"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutronYieldPerAbsorption","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The \"Neutron Yield per Absorption\" is the average number of fission neutrons, both prompt and delayed,\n    emitted per neutron absorbed in a fissionable nuclide or in a nuclear fuel, as specified.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fission_product_yield","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexSymbol":[{"@value":"$\\eta$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The \"Neutron Yield per Absorption\" is the average number of fission neutrons, both prompt and\n    delayed, emitted per neutron absorbed in a fissionable nuclide or in a nuclear fuel, as specified.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q99159075"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeutronYieldPerAbsorption","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neutron Yield per Absorption","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NeutronYieldPerFission","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The \"Neutron Yield per Fission\" is the average number of fission neutrons, both prompt and delayed,\n    emitted per fission event.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fission_product_yield","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexSymbol":[{"@value":"$\\nu$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The \"Neutron Yield per Fission\" is the average number of fission neutrons, both prompt and delayed,\n    emitted per fission event.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q99157909"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NeutronYieldPerFission","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Neutron Yield per Fission","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Non-LeakageProbability","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The \"Non-Leakage Probability\" is the probability that a neutron will not escape from the reactor during\n    the slowing-down process or while it diffuses as a thermal neutron\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NonLeakageProbability"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecated":[{"@value":"true","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/deprecatedInVersion":[{"@value":"3.2.0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Six_factor_formula","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexSymbol":[{"@value":"$\\Lambda$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The \"Non-Leakage Probability\" is the probability that a neutron will not escape from the reactor\n    during the slowing-down process or while it diffuses as a thermal neutron\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q99415566"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Non-Leakage Probability","@language":"en"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NonActivePower","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"\"Non-active Power\", for a two-terminal element or a two-terminal circuit under periodic conditions, is\n    the quantity equal to the square root of the difference of the squares of the apparent power and the active power.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/GigaVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MicroVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PicoVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/TeraVAR"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/VAR"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M1H0T-3D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.electropedia.org/iev/iev.nsf/display?openform&ievref=131-11-43","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"},{"@value":"https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/60010","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition":[{"@value":"$Q^{'} = \\sqrt{{\\left | \\underline{S} \\right |}^2 - P^2}$, where $\\underline{S}$ is apparent power and $P$ is active power.","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/organizedUnder":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ElectricPower"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"\"Non-active Power\", for a two-terminal element or a two-terminal circuit under periodic conditions,\n    is the quantity equal to the square root of the difference of the squares of the apparent power and the active power.\n  ","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"Q'","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/wikidataMatch":[{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q79813060"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment":[{"@value":"Applicable units are those of quantitykind:NonActivePower","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/quantitykind"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Non-active Power","@language":"en"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ActivePower"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ApparentPower"}],"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ElectricPower"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/NonLeakageProbability","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKind"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"The \"Non-Leakage Probability\" is the probability that a neutron will not escape from the reactor during\n    the slowing-down process or while it diffuses as a thermal neutron\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/UNITLESS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Six_factor_formula","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/isoNormativeReference":[{"@value":"http://www.iso.org/iso/catalogue_detail?csnumber=31895","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexSymbol":[{"@value":"$\\Lambda$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription":[{"@value":"The \"Non-Leakage Probability\" is the probability that a neutron will not escape from the reactor\n    during the slowing-down process or while it diffuses