 per Gram Degree Celsius","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloCAL-PER-MIN","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DerivedUnit","http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"\n  A $\\textit{Kilocalorie per Minute}$ is a unit for $\\textit{Heat Flow Rate}$ and $\\textit{Power}$,\n   expressed as $kcal/min$.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/IMPERIAL"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/USCS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier":[{"@value":"69.73333333333333333333333333333335","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplierSN":[{"@value":"6.973333333333333333333333333333335E1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/definedUnitOfSystem":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/USCS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/expression":[{"@value":"$kcal/min$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M1H0T-3D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasFactorUnit":[{"@id":"_:n3-2006"},{"@id":"_:n3-2007"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/HeatFlowRate"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Power"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"kcal/min","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/ucumCode":[{"@value":"kcal.min-1","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UCUMcs"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/uneceCommonCode":[{"@value":"K54","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/unitForQuantityKind":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/HeatFlowRate"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Power"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/unit"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Kilocalorie per Minute","@language":"en"},{"@value":"Kilocalorie per Minute","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}]},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloCAL-PER-MOL","@type":["http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/DerivedUnit","http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit"],"http://purl.org/dc/terms/description":[{"@value":"<p>The kilocalorie per mole is a derived unit of energy per Avogadro's number of particles. It is the\n    quotient of a kilocalorie (1000 thermochemical gram calories) and a mole, mainly used in the United States. In SI units, it is\n    equal to $4.184 kJ/mol$, or $6.9477 \\times 10 J per molecule$. At room temperature it is equal to 1.688 . Physical quantities\n    measured in $kcal\\cdot mol$ are usually thermodynamical quantities; mostly free energies such as: Heat of vaporization Heat\n    of fusion</p>.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/IMPERIAL"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/USCS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier":[{"@value":"4184.0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplierSN":[{"@value":"4.184E3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/expression":[{"@value":"$kcal/mol$","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A-1E0L2I0M1H0T-2D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasFactorUnit":[{"@id":"_:n3-2008"},{"@id":"_:n3-2009"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MolarEnergy"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"kcal/mol","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/X