nd since 1982 the IUPAC has recommended that the standard for\n    atmospheric pressure should be harmonized to $100,000 Pa = 1 bar \\approx 750.0616827 Torr$. Units derived from the bar are\n    the megabar (symbol: Mbar), kilobar (symbol: kbar), decibar (symbol: dbar), centibar (symbol: cbar), and millibar (symbol:\n    mbar or mb). They are not SI or cgs units, but they are accepted for use with the SI.\n  ","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableSystem":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier":[{"@value":"100000000000.0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplierSN":[{"@value":"1.0E11","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L-1I0M1H0T-2D0"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ForcePerArea"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/VapourPressure"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference":[{"@value":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bar_(unit)","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/prefix":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/prefix/Mega"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/scalingOf":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/BAR"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol":[{"@value":"Mbar","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/ucumCode":[{"@value":"Mbar","@type":"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UCUMcs"}],"http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/unitForQuantityKind":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ForcePerArea"},{"@id":"http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/VapourPressure"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy":[{"@id":"http://qudt.org/3.5.2/vocab/unit"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":[{"@value":"Megabar","@language":"en"},{"@value":"Megabar"